  {
    "id": "n\u0103m\u0103ie\u0219ti",
    "file": "n\u0103m\u0103ie\u0219ti.webp",
    "status": "Available",
    "author": "Pavy Beloiu",
    "category": "Landscapes",
    "topic": "Landscapes",
    "year": 1984,
    "original": "yes",
    "content": {
      "ro": {
        "name": "N\u0103m\u0103ie\u0219ti",
        "description": "Vechea clopotni\u021b\u0103 era o idil\u0103 ascuns\u0103 intre st\u00e2nci; o m\u0103icu\u021b\u0103 zgribulit\u0103 b\u0103tea toaca \u0219i se urca agale s\u0103 trag\u0103 clopotul din turn. St\u00e2ncile din jur \u0219i minaretul sunt aduse anume ca s\u0103 \u00eentregeasc\u0103 peisajul. Coamele copacilor \u0219i st\u0103ncile sunt modelate cu pensula\u021bii viguroase dup\u0103 tehnica modeleului-Cezanne. Poarta deschis\u0103 \u0219i un cr\u00e2mpei de cer l\u00e2ng\u0103 clopot aduc speran\u021b\u0103 \u0219i te \u00eembie s\u0103 urci pe poteca din spatele zidurilor\u2026(colec\u021bia Petre Beloiu-Pite\u0219ti)."
      }
    }
  },
